{"ancestors": "0,9028047", "bizKey": "9028052", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2024-05-22 13:49:31", "detail": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57);\"><strong>减硅：硅片薄片化进展，降低硅片用料成本</strong></span></p><p><br></p><p>HJT电池结构天然适合硅片薄片化，目前头部异质结企业的硅片厚度已达120&m;m，110&m;m、100&m;m厚度硅片正在导入。</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2024/05/22/0f15c430-975d-455a-8b3e-c222b7bc685f-1716359717271.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"></p><p>﻿﻿﻿</p><p>随着细线的推进传统碳钢丝逐渐逼近极限，钨丝有望成为新材料。钨丝具备良好发展前景，行业内主要企业均已开始布局。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2024/05/22/982426d2-8a49-4d8f-8e46-d62530b1b574-1716359731351.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2024/05/22/c7c283ea-bf62-4ac0-9268-ca1a516883a0-1716359739879.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></p>", "firstLetter": "JB", "imgUrl": null, "importance": 2, "level": 2, "limitUpTimes": 0, "name": "减薄", "parentId": 9028047, "pctChg": -1.43, "reason": "硅片减薄片，降低硅片成本", "remark": "", "sort": 3, "status": "1", "subjectId": 9028052, "type": 1, "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2024-05-22 14:35:41"}
